and be nice to me is the one

00:04:51.525 --> 00:04:54.327
difference I think I have from
a lot of people in this room is

00:04:54.327 --> 00:04:57.998
I'm not romantic about
how I make my money.

00:04:57.998 --> 00:04:59.332
And let me be very
clear about this.

00:04:59.332 --> 00:05:04.070
I won email marketing in
1997 for Wine Library.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:06.854
