spammed out and

00:05:06.854 --> 00:05:08.575
not be as effective.

00:05:08.575 --> 00:05:10.877
It's what made me all my money.

00:05:10.877 --> 00:05:14.881
But in 1999, in 2001, in 2003
when all these other people

00:05:14.881 --> 00:05:17.784
started doing email marketing
and I saw the conversion rates

00:05:17.784 --> 00:05:22.396
coming down and I saw the 
Web 2.0 coming up I was okay to

00:05:22.396 --> 00:05:26.159
kill myself and my own business
models 'cause that's much more

00:05:26.159 --> 00:05:28.728
