somebody else do it for you.

00:05:28.728 --> 00:05:29.429
Right?

00:05:29.429 --> 00:05:32.566
I, as a lot of you know,
really did well on Twitter.

00:05:32.566 --> 00:05:34.034
That was my coming-out party.

00:05:34.034 --> 00:05:35.902
