00:05:51.928 --> 00:05:54.992
A lot of you in the tech space
you know this I was really

00:05:54.992 --> 00:05:57.850
at the height of Twitter, right?

00:05:57.850 --> 00:05:58.697
I had it.

00:05:58.697 --> 00:06:01.715
That wasn't fun for me but I
was willing to put myself out of

00:06:01.715 --> 00:06:03.747
business and spend more 
time on other platforms

00:06:03.747 --> 00:06:05.845
