00:06:28.395 --> 00:06:29.889
Meaning I just do it.

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:33.705
We know that
Pokémon Go is happening.

00:06:33.705 --> 00:06:34.682
Right?

00:06:34.682 --> 00:06:36.497
