them feel comfortable to say hi

00:09:27.901 --> 00:09:31.571
to me to in the elevator or
to come with a problem to me.

00:09:31.571 --> 00:09:34.240
I do it because I asked them
where their hometown is so I can

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:37.377
