because if I want to surprise

00:09:45.852 --> 00:09:48.755
and delight them because they're
crushing it that I can get them

00:09:48.755 --> 00:09:51.124
Coachella tickets, right?

00:09:51.124 --> 00:09:54.032
I do it 'cause it has purpose.

00:09:54.032 --> 00:09:58.858
I maintain culture very simply
dictatorship, my actions, and

00:09:58.858 --> 00:10:03.403
the number one and two other
options are meritocracy,

00:10:03.403 --> 00:10:04.941
letting talent speak for itself

00:10:04.941 --> 00:10:08.551
