content over the weekends.

00:16:25.273 --> 00:16:26.882
Why don't you
really pay attention?

00:16:26.882 --> 00:16:29.309
What do you think I'm doing
between 6 PM and 9 PM

00:16:29.309 --> 00:16:30.909
