00:16:30.909 --> 00:16:33.935
I'm documenting
every moment I'm in it.

00:16:33.935 --> 00:16:37.964
I'm spending far less family
time than most but there's a

00:16:37.964 --> 00:16:39.832
whole 'nother
aspect of family time.

00:16:39.832 --> 00:16:41.400
I have a lot of friends
from high school that like to

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:43.536
critique me because it's the
ying and yang of yeah, you're

00:16:43.536 --> 00:16:45.905
