to your man cave and drink six

00:16:51.611 --> 00:16:53.579
Budweiser's and go
to sleep so fuck you.

00:16:53.579 --> 00:16:58.584
(laughter and applause)

00:16:58.584 --> 00:17:02.404
So, just 'cause you're 
in the same house

00:17:02.404 --> 00:17:04.690
as your children
doesn't mean your parenting.

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:06.291
- Amen on that.

00:17:06.291 --> 00:17:07.759
- Yeah.

00:17:07.759 --> 00:17:11.394
- So have you started, I know
for a while you've been talking

00:17:11.394 --> 00:17:15.468
