00:17:37.823 --> 00:17:41.827
then kind of switch the brain to
be in kids mode school, what's

00:17:41.827 --> 00:17:45.598
going on in the world, and then
reset back to being back and

00:17:45.598 --> 00:17:50.670
trying to stab people in the
face and win is hard but

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:53.351
I'm gonna have to pull it off.

00:17:53.351 --> 00:17:56.242
It's important to me I'm getting
a lot of time with my kids on

00:17:56.242 --> 00:17:59.178
