00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:09.687
It just doesn't feel as right as

00:18:09.687 --> 00:18:12.908
it did 18 months ago, 
12 months ago.

00:18:12.908 --> 00:18:15.860
I'm a smoke than
fire guy, right?

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:19.065
What I'm doing right now is I'm
selling myself more than telling

00:18:19.065 --> 00:18:21.300
you a story this is
something I want to do.

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:24.070
And so I'm beating on my
own brain to get there.

00:18:24.070 --> 00:18:28.507
- It goes back to what you said
too, switching your mindset from

00:18:28.507 --> 00:18:32.111
