lot of times if you're at the

00:18:32.111 --> 00:18:34.814
house from 6 to 9 but
you're not present--

00:18:34.814 --> 00:18:38.751
- This is happening all day.

00:18:38.751 --> 00:18:41.320
I think what you're sensing
and I'm sure a lot of you don't

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:44.957
