comfortable in my own skin.

00:18:44.957 --> 00:18:48.627
I'm comfortable with my
politically correct shortcomings

00:18:48.627 --> 00:18:52.098
because it is my life and my
kids' life and my wife's life.

00:18:52.098 --> 00:18:55.763
I know what's happening
inside our four walls.

00:18:55.763 --> 00:18:58.170
I just wish more people
would feel comfortable.

00:18:58.170 --> 00:19:01.307
I think if you're happy
so much more happens.

00:19:01.307 --> 00:19:04.944
So I know a lot of people,
this one woman is the CEO of a

00:19:04.944 --> 00:19:06.746
company that I
invested in, she's amazing.

00:19:06.746 --> 00:19:11.250
She feels the need to check the
box to the world, to her mother,

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:13.910
