doesn't want to be home.

00:19:27.066 --> 00:19:28.634
She wants to be
running her business.

00:19:28.634 --> 00:19:32.104
She loves her family, she
just on fire and she wants it.

00:19:32.104 --> 00:19:33.989
And so I don't think people

00:19:33.989 --> 00:19:38.010
