00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:39.645
There's a lot of
different ways to do it.

00:19:39.645 --> 00:19:40.846
Everybody has her own way.

00:19:40.846 --> 00:19:43.315
You're looking at a kid, not
anymore, but you're looking at a

00:19:43.315 --> 00:19:46.363
