to sleep and I love my dad more

00:19:57.430 --> 00:19:58.631
than breathing.

00:19:58.631 --> 00:20:00.399
Me and my dad have it awesome.

00:20:00.399 --> 00:20:02.968
I think we've gotten into a very
hard-core politically correct

00:20:02.968 --> 00:20:06.172
