00:20:19.221 --> 00:20:22.221
So on the work life balance 
thing, I've got my thing.

00:20:22.221 --> 00:20:24.323
It's what feels right.

00:20:24.323 --> 00:20:27.526
I think everybody in here has
to keep themselves happy first,

00:20:27.526 --> 00:20:29.361
then you can make
other people happy.

00:20:29.361 --> 00:20:32.264
And it evolves and it changes.

00:20:32.264 --> 00:20:35.334
I'm not convinced that I might
not just one year wake-up and

00:20:35.334 --> 00:20:36.802
just check out for a year.

00:20:36.802 --> 00:20:38.537
Just 'cause I might.

00:20:38.537 --> 00:20:39.438
Just I don't know.

00:20:39.438 --> 00:20:42.108
It's funny to me that it runs
through my head sometimes maybe

00:20:42.108 --> 00:20:43.809
in-between businesses
if something happens.

00:20:43.809 --> 00:20:44.610
I don't know.

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:45.277
I don't know.

00:20:45.277 --> 00:20:49.782
But right now I can tell you
hustling, producing for my

00:20:49.782 --> 00:20:52.218
family, producing for myself,
producing for my employees and

00:20:52.218 --> 00:20:55.962
my team and producing 
content for you guys

00:20:55.962 --> 00:20:57.823
I'm as happy as it gets.

00:20:57.823 --> 00:20:58.557
- Awesome.

