on a screen or wherever

01:10:28.745 --> 01:10:31.233
we're living in those days and 
show them an episode

01:10:31.233 --> 01:10:35.098
of AJ turning 21, super cool.

01:10:35.098 --> 01:10:39.102
The episodes with my
dad were super fun to me.

01:10:39.102 --> 01:10:43.354
Again, similar stuff when he's
gone I can have that content.

01:10:45.274 --> 01:10:45.942
You know what?

01:10:45.942 --> 01:10:47.618
My favorite episode 
was the episode where

01:10:47.618 --> 01:10:49.145
I ate all those different foods.

01:10:49.145 --> 01:10:52.215
The first episode
to go really viral.

01:10:52.215 --> 01:10:56.652
I ate like dirt and
cereal and cherries.

01:10:56.652 --> 01:10:59.322
That episode caught the
attention of Conan O'Brien's

01:10:59.322 --> 01:11:03.456
producers and then I did 
Conan and you have to

01:11:03.456 --> 01:11:05.758
remember this Scoble, right?
This was 2007.

01:11:05.758 --> 01:11:06.496
- [Robert] Stinky socks.

01:11:06.496 --> 01:11:08.131
- That's right, socks, dirt.

01:11:08.131 --> 01:11:10.810
Conan O'Brien's producers
emailed me and said we'd like

01:11:10.810 --> 01:11:12.168
you to do the
Conan O'Brien show.

01:11:12.168 --> 01:11:13.991
Now this is 2007 most people

01:11:13.991 --> 01:11:15.872
don't even know what 
YouTube is yet, right?

01:11:15.872 --> 01:11:19.275
I looked very careful at the
email address because I thought

01:11:19.275 --> 01:11:21.010
it was my friends
playing a joke on me.

01:11:21.010 --> 01:11:22.403
(audience laughter)

01:11:22.403 --> 01:11:25.214
I emailed them back, 
I held my breath, it was real.

01:11:25.214 --> 01:11:27.984
This is how tight knit the
entire internet community was in

01:11:27.984 --> 01:11:31.458
2007, I announce that I'm
going to be on Conan

01:11:31.458 --> 01:11:34.090
the whole internet had my back.

01:11:34.090 --> 01:11:39.362
Gruber from Daring Fireball,
Boing Boing, Digg, Reddit,

01:11:39.362 --> 01:11:40.463
everybody.

01:11:40.463 --> 01:11:42.765
All of the few people that
were on Twitter at that point,

01:11:42.765 --> 01:11:44.082
everybody.

01:11:44.082 --> 01:11:48.337
I felt, I don't know if I've ever
felt more professional pressure

01:11:48.337 --> 01:11:51.007
than being in the green room
looking at Twitter and this

01:11:51.007 --> 01:11:56.012
again 2007 early and just seeing
basically the entire Web 2.0 and

01:11:56.012 --> 01:11:59.916
remember I referenced it earlier
tonight, I was a newcomer to it.

01:11:59.916 --> 01:12:02.059
I was this kind of 
different thing

01:12:02.059 --> 01:12:04.446
and they all rallied behind me.

01:12:04.446 --> 01:12:08.991
iJustine and Ze Frank and these
early video bloggers they all

01:12:08.991 --> 01:12:11.661
were like you did it for us.

01:12:11.661 --> 01:12:12.895
You're going to be on.

01:12:12.895 --> 01:12:16.199
A video blogger on the Conan
show and I was sitting there

01:12:16.199 --> 01:12:19.368
I was like and I had 
never been on TV.

01:12:19.368 --> 01:12:22.705
So like here I am never been
on TV and I'm going on this big

01:12:22.705 --> 01:12:26.142
stage and what I found out later
Conan doesn't, I didn't know

01:12:26.142 --> 01:12:28.878
this, I didn't know there was
anybody who did it different,

01:12:28.878 --> 01:12:29.919
Conan doesn't rehearse.

01:12:29.919 --> 01:12:31.921
When I went on to do the
Today Show and Dr. Oz and

01:12:31.921 --> 01:12:34.250
Ellen Degeneres and all that,
they rehearsed.

01:12:34.250 --> 01:12:36.152
Conan's improv.

01:12:36.152 --> 01:12:37.451
Luckily, I ended up being improv

01:12:37.451 --> 01:12:39.188
but I didn't know 
that about myself.

01:12:39.188 --> 01:12:42.525
Literally, I'm just like sitting
there behind this curtain just

01:12:42.525 --> 01:12:46.258
like this and they're like your
go out in three, two and

01:12:46.258 --> 01:12:50.261
I'm saying shit I have to 
deliver big for the whole

01:12:50.261 --> 01:12:53.536
Web 2.0, video blogging
community, not just for me.

01:12:53.536 --> 01:12:56.539
I get pushed out I don't know
if any of you have seen it,

01:12:56.539 --> 01:12:59.496
it crushed. I got Conan to 
eat dirt, he's unbelievable.

01:12:59.496 --> 01:13:01.510
I probably get paid the best
compliment I'll ever get paid

01:13:01.510 --> 01:13:04.280
