the crowd goes crazy.

01:13:04.280 --> 01:13:07.049
Conan turns to me, I didn't
realize how notoriously tough

01:13:07.049 --> 01:13:08.317
Conan was on his guests.

01:13:08.317 --> 01:13:11.224
These are I learned later in
life he looks he goes

01:13:11.224 --> 01:13:12.321
that was phenomenal.

01:13:12.321 --> 01:13:14.590
He goes so where do you perform?

01:13:14.590 --> 01:13:16.025
And I go what?

01:13:16.025 --> 01:13:18.094
He goes where do
you do your act?

01:13:18.094 --> 01:13:20.763
And I was like oh
I'm not a comedian.

01:13:20.763 --> 01:13:22.614
I'm a wine guy. 
He goes get the fuck out here.

01:13:22.614 --> 01:13:26.423
(audience laughter)

01:13:26.423 --> 01:13:28.613
(applause)

01:13:28.613 --> 01:13:32.107
And so I would say the 
